    {
        "content": "<p>xia-chao opened <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14448\">PR #14448</a> from <code>xia-chao:reject-zero-http-outgoing-body-options</code> to <code>bytecodealliance:main</code>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Both options must be non-zero at the implementation level. Passing zero used to misbehave: <code>buffer-chunks=0</code> panicked a worker under <code>serve</code> and the whole process under <code>run</code>, and <code>chunk-size=0</code> returned an empty body with a 200. They are now <code>Option&lt;NonZeroUsize&gt;</code>, like <code>gc_zeal_alloc_counter</code>, so valid configurations are unaffected.<br>\n</p>\n</blockquote>",
        "id": 627858096,
        "sender_full_name": "Wasmtime GitHub notifications bot",
        "timestamp": 1790703671
